{
  "_about": "News outlets read for state, local-government and community reports, by geopolitical zone. Nigeria only. 'medium' says what kind of outlet it is: newspaper, radio, tv, magazine, wire (news agency) or online. 'feed' is a direct RSS feed. 'google' means the outlet has no usable feed (or blocks automated readers) and is read through a Google News query restricted to its domain. 'offline' means no working website or feed was found; those states are still covered by the per-state and per-community searches, which pick up whoever is reporting. Every 'feed' and 'google' entry answered with recent items when this file was last checked (2026-10-06). To add an outlet, add an entry here - no code changes needed.",
